1260
00:47:46,214 --> 00:47:48,514
That lady is lying right now.

1261
00:47:48,814 --> 00:47:51,184
- She's lying to get you to work.
- Totally.

1262
00:47:51,484 --> 00:47:52,754
- It's here.
- You...

1263
00:47:52,754 --> 00:47:54,584
- Is the coffee here?
- Yes, but she's lying.

1264
00:47:54,584 --> 00:47:55,624
Oh, my gosh.

1265
00:47:56,084 --> 00:47:57,254
You get tricked all the time.

1266
00:47:57,824 --> 00:47:59,324
- But getting tricked...
- The one who's lying right now...

1267
00:47:59,324 --> 00:48:00,654
is you, sir.

1268
00:48:01,254 --> 00:48:02,794
- You get tricked all the time.
- Sir!

1269
00:48:03,094 --> 00:48:04,764
- Sir.
- You're not the owner, are you?

1270
00:48:05,124 --> 00:48:06,134
You're an actor, right?

1271
00:48:06,994 --> 00:48:08,794
You cast an actor, didn't you?

1272
00:48:09,604 --> 00:48:11,604
Sir, don't be mean to us.

1273
00:48:12,374 --> 00:48:13,974
All right. I'm taking these...

1274
00:48:13,974 --> 00:48:15,574
- if you're done eating.
- Oh, my.

1275
00:48:16,144 --> 00:48:17,374
Get to work.

1276
00:48:17,374 --> 00:48:19,344
- I'm off.
- No, wait.

1277
00:48:19,774 --> 00:48:21,014
But I'm still eating.

1278
00:48:21,014 --> 00:48:22,174
Okay, hurry.

1279
00:48:22,174 --> 00:48:23,914
- Gosh.
- Sir.

1280
00:48:24,144 --> 00:48:26,114
Now then, hurry up and dig up garlic.

1281
00:48:29,154 --> 00:48:31,724
- Sir. You're an actor, right?
- I'm confused right now.

1282
00:48:32,084 --> 00:48:33,124
He's our acting senior.

1283
00:48:33,854 --> 00:48:35,054
- Sir!
- Sir!

1284
00:48:35,054 --> 00:48:36,624
- Sir.
- Our acting senior.

1285
00:48:36,624 --> 00:48:38,194
- I'm done here.
- Don't be mean to us.

1286
00:48:38,764 --> 00:48:39,794
Sir.

1287
00:48:40,194 --> 00:48:41,394
He's good.

1288
00:48:42,134 --> 00:48:43,704
Let's check out how much we dug up.

1289
00:48:43,864 --> 00:48:44,904
In teams of two.

1290
00:48:45,104 --> 00:48:46,874
This requires a lot of back work.

1291
00:48:46,874 --> 00:48:47,934
(The final stretch of garlic digging begins)

1292
00:48:47,934 --> 00:48:49,074
Let's do this.

1293
00:48:50,104 --> 00:48:53,874
(Cut off the garlic stems.)

1294
00:48:55,644 --> 00:48:59,254
(Shake off the dirt and collect the bulbs in the net.)

1295
00:49:01,684 --> 00:49:05,054
(One person cuts the stems.)

1296
00:49:05,654 --> 00:49:07,924
Into the net.

1297
00:49:08,924 --> 00:49:09,964
Into the net.

1298
00:49:09,964 --> 00:49:10,964
Into the net.

1299
00:49:10,964 --> 00:49:11,964
(The other follows behind, gathering them up.)

1300
00:49:12,864 --> 00:49:14,994
The garlic sure is plump,

1301
00:49:14,994 --> 00:49:16,464
as farming went well this year.

1302
00:49:17,364 --> 00:49:18,834
- The garlic sure is big.
- For real.

1303
00:49:18,934 --> 00:49:20,404
- They are huge.
- Right?

1304
00:49:20,404 --> 00:49:21,404
(The garlic is more precious after being harvested by hand.)

1305
00:49:21,404 --> 00:49:23,174
I only knew garlic as something to eat.

1306
00:49:25,374 --> 00:49:27,614
There was no opportunity for me to harvest garlic.

1307
00:49:27,614 --> 00:49:28,814
(Cutting)

1308
00:49:29,214 --> 00:49:32,284
(And more cutting)

1309
00:49:34,484 --> 00:49:39,194
(Collecting them into the net)

1310
00:49:39,654 --> 00:49:40,994
Done. One net is full now.

1311
00:49:40,994 --> 00:49:42,694
We already filled one net.

1312
00:49:42,794 --> 00:49:44,664
- Same here.
- We're also almost done.

1313
00:49:44,664 --> 00:49:45,764
We're quick.

1314
00:49:46,694 --> 00:49:48,634
We may be quick, but look at the amount.

1315
00:49:48,634 --> 00:49:50,404
- True.
- There's still that much left.

1316
00:49:51,334 --> 00:49:54,974
(Singing work songs)

1317
00:49:55,844 --> 00:49:59,144
(Cutting and collecting the garlic in silence)

1318
00:49:59,274 --> 00:50:00,874
Have we not gotten to here yet?

1319
00:50:02,514 --> 00:50:04,444
We haven't. Oh, my. Unbelievable.

1320
00:50:04,784 --> 00:50:05,784
Unbelievable.

1321
00:50:06,584 --> 00:50:07,614
When will we finish?

1322
00:50:08,054 --> 00:50:09,084
We can do it.

1323
00:50:09,884 --> 00:50:11,024
Up I go.

1324
00:50:11,024 --> 00:50:14,894
(The sheer volume leaves everyone speechless.)

1325
00:50:16,264 --> 00:50:18,064
Jung Ja. I heard you were going to Seoul.

1326
00:50:19,964 --> 00:50:21,994
So what about going to Seoul?

1327
00:50:21,994 --> 00:50:23,034
(No wonder it was quiet.)

1328
00:50:23,704 --> 00:50:27,404
You know the saying, "You don't know what you've got until it's gone?"

1329
00:50:28,474 --> 00:50:29,704
Aren't I right?

1330
00:50:31,704 --> 00:50:32,714
Really.

1331
00:50:32,714 --> 00:50:35,144
- Why isn't anyone answering?
- For real.

1332
00:50:35,574 --> 00:50:37,544
Where's my answer? Anyone?

1333
00:50:37,884 --> 00:50:39,214
How long will you keep this up?

1334
00:50:39,214 --> 00:50:40,854
(Laughing)

1335
00:50:40,954 --> 00:50:42,414
If the viewers are having dinner...

1336
00:50:42,414 --> 00:50:44,284
without talking...

1337
00:50:44,284 --> 00:50:46,624
and we don't talk either, what are we to do?

1338
00:50:47,294 --> 00:50:49,194
We might fill about five nets.

1339
00:50:49,494 --> 00:50:50,964
He's off-topic.

1340
00:50:52,224 --> 00:50:53,764
Will we get five nets at least?

1341
00:50:53,864 --> 00:50:56,034
- We have enough.
- It's more than enough.

1342
00:50:56,034 --> 00:50:57,234
- We might get over five nets.
- Right?

1343
00:50:57,234 --> 00:50:59,204
There are plenty more. We might even get six.

1344
00:50:59,204 --> 00:51:02,604
Good. That'll get us 85 dollars. No, 90 dollars.

1345
00:51:02,604 --> 00:51:04,204
(6 nets times 15 dollars equals 90 dollars)

1346
00:51:04,644 --> 00:51:07,214
One, two... We made great progress.

1347
00:51:07,214 --> 00:51:08,374
(Completed 4 nets)

1348
00:51:08,574 --> 00:51:09,784
No, we didn't.

1349
00:51:09,784 --> 00:51:12,144
We earned 150 dollars yesterday.

1350
00:51:12,144 --> 00:51:14,054
(They need a minimum of 100 dollars to use until tomorrow.)

1351
00:51:14,284 --> 00:51:15,584
Why does it feel empty...

1352
00:51:16,224 --> 00:51:17,324
despite how much we dug up?

1353
00:51:17,324 --> 00:51:19,024
(They need to fill at least 7 nets.)

1354
00:51:20,294 --> 00:51:23,594
(Current time: 12pm, 3 hours into the garlic harvest)

1355
00:51:23,594 --> 00:51:24,664
The sun is rising.

1356
00:51:24,724 --> 00:51:26,094
- It's hot.
- It sure is hot.

1357
00:51:26,734 --> 00:51:27,764
It's hot.

1358
00:51:28,864 --> 00:51:30,534
(Groaning)

1359
00:51:30,534 --> 00:51:31,764
(My back hurts.)

1360
00:51:31,764 --> 00:51:32,804
My back.

1361
00:51:33,104 --> 00:51:35,034
My back hurts more today than yesterday.

1362
00:51:35,034 --> 00:51:36,144
The back pain is no joke.

1363
00:51:36,144 --> 00:51:37,204
(Being hunched over is causing back pain.)

1364
00:51:37,804 --> 00:51:39,214
One net is big.

1365
00:51:40,214 --> 00:51:41,274
A lot goes in.

1366
00:51:42,584 --> 00:51:46,654
(Even filling up one single net isn't easy.)

1367
00:51:47,514 --> 00:51:51,554
(3 more nets until their targeted number of over 7)

1368
00:51:56,394 --> 00:51:59,794
(Starting to act weirdly)

1369
00:52:00,264 --> 00:52:03,134
Jung Seok working until today...

1370
00:52:03,134 --> 00:52:04,504
really helps us boost the quantity.

1371
00:52:04,504 --> 00:52:06,104
For real, Jung Seok. Thank you.

1372
00:52:06,874 --> 00:52:09,744
We're running short on time.

1373
00:52:10,044 --> 00:52:11,644
Please focus and move fast.

1374
00:52:11,944 --> 00:52:13,444
(Laughing)

1375
00:52:13,874 --> 00:52:15,314
No more talking now.

1376
00:52:17,921 --> 00:52:20,751
We're running short on time.

1377
00:52:21,151 --> 00:52:22,691
Please focus and move fast.

1378
00:52:22,891 --> 00:52:24,461
(Laughing)

1379
00:52:24,861 --> 00:52:26,461
No more talking now.

1380
00:52:28,291 --> 00:52:29,431
- What...
- No more talking?

1381
00:52:30,361 --> 00:52:33,271
Director Se Hee. This is the first variety show...

1382
00:52:33,271 --> 00:52:35,771
where we're being told to focus and work only.

1383
00:52:36,101 --> 00:52:37,271
Is this some documentary?

1384
00:52:37,641 --> 00:52:39,911
I'll watch how well the show will go...

1385
00:52:40,241 --> 00:52:41,271
with me...

1386
00:52:41,971 --> 00:52:44,511
being quiet all day long.

1387
00:52:44,511 --> 00:52:45,581
(Rage level 1)

1388
00:52:45,681 --> 00:52:48,911
See? I'm a very taciturn person.

1389
00:52:49,451 --> 00:52:50,451
Start!

1390
00:52:51,221 --> 00:52:53,291
I won't say a single word from now on.

1391
00:52:54,491 --> 00:52:55,651
Why are you filled with rage?

1392
00:52:55,651 --> 00:52:56,691
(Laughing)

1393
00:52:56,921 --> 00:52:59,531
(I'm not talking.)

1394
00:52:59,961 --> 00:53:02,391
Please take a cool and slow shot of Sun Young.

1395
00:53:03,361 --> 00:53:04,401
Forget it!

1396
00:53:05,601 --> 00:53:08,401
(Turning her back on the camera)

1397
00:53:08,931 --> 00:53:10,871
(Moving in)

1398
00:53:12,101 --> 00:53:13,611
What's up with you? Seriously.

1399
00:53:14,011 --> 00:53:15,171
What's wrong with you?

1400
00:53:15,941 --> 00:53:18,511
You're practically going to bump into my face.

1401
00:53:18,641 --> 00:53:19,911
Really, mister.

1402
00:53:21,881 --> 00:53:22,981
Stop it.

1403
00:53:22,981 --> 00:53:24,981
Is this "Music Bank?" Stop it.

1404
00:53:26,221 --> 00:53:29,051
(With camera moves straight out of a music show)

1405
00:53:29,591 --> 00:53:32,291
Really, is this "Music Bank" or what?

1406
00:53:32,991 --> 00:53:34,591
Sun Young is driving me crazy.

1407
00:53:35,291 --> 00:53:36,761
I feel a little better now.

1408
00:53:37,631 --> 00:53:38,701
I just can't.

1409
00:53:38,701 --> 00:53:39,931
(Laughing)

1410
00:53:40,101 --> 00:53:42,531
- Is the first row cutting done?
- We're done cutting.

1411
00:53:42,531 --> 00:53:43,841
- Over there?
- Yes.

1412
00:53:44,371 --> 00:53:46,871
I can see the finish line too. I'm almost done.

1413
00:53:49,481 --> 00:53:50,911
This is fun.

1414
00:53:51,181 --> 00:53:52,781
No, not fun. We did a lot.

1415
00:53:52,981 --> 00:53:54,481
"Fun?"

1416
00:53:54,481 --> 00:53:55,481
(Laughing)

1417
00:53:55,951 --> 00:53:57,221
Is earning money fun?

1418
00:53:57,451 --> 00:53:58,521
It's fun.

1419
00:53:58,521 --> 00:53:59,651
(It's fun when you harvest a lot and earn a lot.)

1420
00:53:59,891 --> 00:54:00,951
One, two...

1421
00:54:01,421 --> 00:54:02,451
Gosh, we filled up a lot.

1422
00:54:02,451 --> 00:54:03,821
(The garlic nets pile up before they know it.)

1423
00:54:03,821 --> 00:54:04,861
I told you we did a lot.

1424
00:54:05,561 --> 00:54:06,731
I finished them all.

1425
00:54:08,031 --> 00:54:09,131
I'm done.

1426
00:54:09,131 --> 00:54:10,201
(When the youngest puts them in the net, )

1427
00:54:10,861 --> 00:54:13,571
(the third one transfers it.)

1428
00:54:14,531 --> 00:54:15,701
We did our best.

1429
00:54:16,171 --> 00:54:18,771
(Achieved their goal of 7 nets, a total of 105 dollars)

1430
00:54:19,101 --> 00:54:20,811
Those nets are the last, right?

1431
00:54:21,271 --> 00:54:22,441
The ones we each have.

1432
00:54:22,441 --> 00:54:23,441
(The garlic harvest is nearing its end.)

1433
00:54:23,781 --> 00:54:25,911
(Everyone joins forces...)

1434
00:54:26,381 --> 00:54:29,211
(to get every last bulb.)

1435
00:54:29,621 --> 00:54:31,421
Okay. How many nets in total?

1436
00:54:33,421 --> 00:54:35,921
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight. Eight nets.

1437
00:54:36,161 --> 00:54:37,161
- Nine.
- Nine.

1438
00:54:37,591 --> 00:54:38,791
We did a lot.

1439
00:54:39,861 --> 00:54:41,691
Good job on harvesting and putting the garlic...

1440
00:54:41,691 --> 00:54:43,301
- in the nets.
- Right.

1441
00:54:43,561 --> 00:54:45,131
- Nine nets.
- Here's your payment...

1442
00:54:45,131 --> 00:54:47,101
- for the nine nets.
- Okay.

1443
00:54:49,171 --> 00:54:50,771
- Thank you.
- Well done.

1444
00:54:50,771 --> 00:54:51,841
(9 nets times 15 dollars)

1445
00:54:51,841 --> 00:54:52,841
Ninety dollars.

1446
00:54:53,341 --> 00:54:55,311
- No, 135 dollars.
- It's 130 dollars.

1447
00:54:55,311 --> 00:54:56,441
Why are you deducting money?

1448
00:54:57,111 --> 00:54:59,011
If it's 130 dollars, we've earned quite a lot.

1449
00:54:59,011 --> 00:55:00,011
(Happy)

1450
00:55:00,351 --> 00:55:01,451
(And)

1451
00:55:01,451 --> 00:55:03,851
All right. Good job.

1452
00:55:03,851 --> 00:55:04,981
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

1453
00:55:04,981 --> 00:55:06,551
- Thank you.
- Oh, dear.

1454
00:55:06,551 --> 00:55:07,951
- Oh, gosh.
- I'll carry it, Sun Young.

1455
00:55:08,121 --> 00:55:09,661
- I've got more for you.
- Thank you.

1456
00:55:09,661 --> 00:55:11,361
- Here. Garlic scapes.
- Garlic scapes!

1457
00:55:11,361 --> 00:55:12,361
- Yes.
- Oh, my.

1458
00:55:12,361 --> 00:55:14,091
- I love garlic scapes.
- Garlic scapes.

1459
00:55:14,091 --> 00:55:16,161
- Korean garlic scapes.
- These garlic scapes are fresh.

1460
00:55:16,561 --> 00:55:18,201
- Here's for Jung Seok.
- What?

1461
00:55:18,201 --> 00:55:19,301
This net.

1462
00:55:19,301 --> 00:55:21,601
- Really?
- A net for me? A net just for me?

1463
00:55:21,671 --> 00:55:22,741
- Really?
- Yes.

1464
00:55:22,741 --> 00:55:24,241
- Well done.
- Thank you.

1465
00:55:24,241 --> 00:55:25,641
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

1466
00:55:25,671 --> 00:55:27,411
Thank you, sir.

1467
00:55:27,411 --> 00:55:29,541
(Thank you, dear senior actor.)

1468
00:55:30,011 --> 00:55:32,441
(Drinking coffee right away)

1469
00:55:32,911 --> 00:55:36,181
(Sipping)

1470
00:55:37,081 --> 00:55:38,751
(Refreshing)

1471
00:55:39,221 --> 00:55:40,251
That hits the spot.

1472
00:55:40,251 --> 00:55:41,721
(Nothing short of heavenly)

1473
00:55:42,151 --> 00:55:44,691
(Joyfully harvested)

1474
00:55:45,261 --> 00:55:47,961
(Gathered with sweat and hard work, Seosan garlic)

1475
00:55:48,191 --> 00:55:50,801
When the garlic is laid out and dried naturally,

1476
00:55:51,331 --> 00:55:53,301
they won't rot.

1477
00:55:55,301 --> 00:55:59,941
(Shipped fresh nationwide)

1478
00:56:00,441 --> 00:56:01,671
Can't you stay?

1479
00:56:02,271 --> 00:56:03,411
Must you leave?

1480
00:56:04,211 --> 00:56:05,211
Must you?

1481
00:56:06,181 --> 00:56:08,381
I didn't think we'd say goodbye here.

1482
00:56:08,381 --> 00:56:09,651
- What a bummer.
- Right?

1483
00:56:09,851 --> 00:56:10,951
- Sun Young.
- We might cry a little...

1484
00:56:10,951 --> 00:56:13,451
in the car after seeing you off.

1485
00:56:13,451 --> 00:56:14,821
- We'll hold back right now.
- Right.

1486
00:56:15,251 --> 00:56:17,121
- Let's talk on the phone. Now go.
- Okay.

1487
00:56:18,691 --> 00:56:19,891
Okay, get in.

1488
00:56:19,891 --> 00:56:21,131
- No, you go first.
- No.

1489
00:56:21,131 --> 00:56:22,131
- No.
- You leave first.

1490
00:56:22,131 --> 00:56:23,861
- Gosh, I...
- The guest must leave first.

1491
00:56:23,861 --> 00:56:24,901
- I'm leaving.
- Go. Hurry.

1492
00:56:24,901 --> 00:56:26,401
- Bye.
- Bye.

1493
00:56:26,401 --> 00:56:27,771
- Bye.
- Bye, Yoon Seo.

1494
00:56:27,901 --> 00:56:29,501
- Bye.
- Thank you for coming.

1495
00:56:29,701 --> 00:56:31,001
Bye.

1496
00:56:31,641 --> 00:56:32,771
Bye!

1497
00:56:32,771 --> 00:56:34,011
(Thanks, Jung Seok!)

1498
00:56:34,211 --> 00:56:35,671
This feels weird.

1499
00:56:35,941 --> 00:56:38,011
- Seeing people off is tough.
- Yes, it's tough.

1500
00:56:38,411 --> 00:56:40,551
(Feeling oddly sad)

1501
00:56:40,711 --> 00:56:42,111
- It was fun.
- Totally.

1502
00:56:42,111 --> 00:56:43,151
But really...

1503
00:56:43,721 --> 00:56:46,521
It's different after starting out with five people.

1504
00:56:47,151 --> 00:56:49,661
Let's meet in a drama one day.

1505
00:56:50,261 --> 00:56:53,291
- You two were like actual siblings.
- Jung Seok.

1506
00:56:53,291 --> 00:56:54,291
- Totally.
- Yes.

1507
00:56:54,291 --> 00:56:56,401
Why not head home while listening to Jung Seok's music...

1508
00:56:56,401 --> 00:56:58,201
- to reminisce about him?
- Shall we?

1509
00:56:58,561 --> 00:56:59,771
- Jung Seok.
- Being in the same work...

1510
00:56:59,771 --> 00:57:00,971
would be fun.

1511
00:57:01,531 --> 00:57:03,701
Bye, Jung Seok!

1512
00:57:04,701 --> 00:57:05,801
Can you turn the volume up?

1513
00:57:07,571 --> 00:57:09,341
(You are my love)

1514
00:57:09,341 --> 00:57:11,241
(Calling Jung Seok)

1515
00:57:11,241 --> 00:57:12,711
Unbelievable. Hey, Jung Seok.

1516
00:57:12,711 --> 00:57:13,711
(Laughing)

1517
00:57:13,711 --> 00:57:15,881
- Yes, Jung Ah?
- The kids are going wild,

